  "conformsTo": "http://mlcommons.org/croissant/1.1",
  "name": "Time-Series-Library",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\tTime-Series-Library (TSLib)\n\t\n\nTSLib is an open-source library for deep learning researchers, especially for deep time series analysis.\nWe provide a neat code base to evaluate advanced deep time series models or develop your model, which covers five mainstream tasks: long- and short-term forecasting, imputation, anomaly detection, and classification.\nThis benchmark collection is designed to evaluate and develop advanced deep time-series models. For an in-depth exploration of current\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/thuml/Time-Series-Library.",
  "alternateName": [
    "thuml/Time-Series-Library",
    "Time-Series-Library (TSLib)"
  ],
  "creator": {
